reviews.text:
First of all staff and service here are excellent, the place has a great vibe and staff were super chill and welcoming, harder to find around shoreditch nowadays.

The gyudon;

Rice is great, cooked perfectly, and beef is tender and also cooked to the perfect balance, however it just tasted ok, not bad or anything just ok. I wouldn't go out of my way to come back but if I was about and wanted gyudon sure I'd try some of their more unique offerings like the cheese one.
